<title>GERMANY: BOBSLEIGH-WORLD CUP FOUR-MAN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BOBSLEIGH-WORLD CUP FOUR-MAN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ALTENBERG, Germany 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
