<p>four-man event at the opening World Cup meeting on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Germany III (Harald Czudaj/Torsten Voss/Alexander Szelig/Udo</p>
<p>    Lehmann)		     one minute 53.70 seconds</p>
<p>(56.59/57.11)</p>
